@startuml offering-capability-boundary
title Offering / Capability Boundary ; per ADR-ES-021 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Capability" as Cap

O --> Cap : exercises
O -[dotted]- Cap : is NOT
Cap -[dotted]- O : is NOT

note right
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 5:
  Offering exercises Capability. A Capability is exercised by
  an Offering, but an Offering is NOT a Capability.
end note

@enduml
